{{Crusaders' Coliseum}}
'''Trial of the Crusader''' is an epic 10- and 25-player raid dungeon in the [[Crusaders' Coliseum]] with five encounters.

==Bosses==
There are a number of boss encounters in the Trial of the Crusader:
*The {{NPC||Beasts of Northrend}} encounter, which is made up of three sub-encounters
**{{Mob|Gormok the Impaler}}, a magnataur
**{{Mob|Acidmaw}} and {{Mob|Dreadscale}}, {{NPC||Acidmaw and Dreadscale}}, a pair of jormungar
**{{Mob|Icehowl}}, a wendigo
*{{Mob|Lord Jaraxxus (tactics)||Lord Jaraxxus}}, a man'ari eredar
*The {{NPC||Faction Champions}}, a PvP-styled encounter against a team of the opposite faction
*{{Mob|Eydis Darkbane}} and {{Mob|Fjola Lightbane}}, the {{NPC||Twin Val'kyr}}
*{{Mob|Anub'arak (Trial of the Crusader tactics)||Anub'arak}}, a surprise ''fifth'' encounter that raid parties are dropped in upon
[[File:Trial of the Crusader bosses.jpg|thumb|left|500px|The Trial of the Crusader bosses]]
